                    "BTTScriptType" : 0,
                    "BTTAppleScriptString" : "tell application \"BetterTouchTool\"\r\tset theSelection to get_string_variable \"BTTTextSelection\"\rend tell\r\rtell application \"Terminal\"\r\tactivate\r\tif (count of windows) < 1 then\r\t\tdo script \"\" -- opens a new Terminal window if none exists\r\tend if\r\tset theTab to selected tab of the first window\r\tdo script theSelection in theTab\rend tell",
